From 28078f9bdd13f0e3043cee0ccaf2ea3a4447010f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 16:45:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Split field-add phone into WhatsApp + Alternate, add live
 duplicate check
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Field-added dealer's phone was a single optional field with zero
duplicate detection, so reps in a hurry could log the same shop twice
under different spellings. Now collects a mandatory WhatsApp number
and an optional Alternate number, and checks both live (debounced) as
the rep types against every other field-added dealer AND real dealer
profiles by phone — a non-blocking heads-up banner, never a hard stop
(the same number can legitimately belong to two different shops).

Adds check_duplicate_dealer_phone() RPC; add_field_dealer() and
admin_list_field_dealers() updated for the two-number schema.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
